              <div class="text-sm">
                <div class="text-fg-muted leading-relaxed break-words [&amp;_a]:text-accent-fg [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_code]:bg-line/5 [&amp;_code]:px-1 [&amp;_code]:rounded [&amp;_code]:text-xs [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_p]:my-0 [&amp;_strong]:font-semibold" style="overflow: hidden;">Jupyter <strong>deployment</strong>
